<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Starlight - 7 Months</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #09001a, #22004d, #000);
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .container {
      padding: 30px;
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .stars {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .heart {
      font-size: 55px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: scale(1);
      }
      50% {
        transform: scale(1.15);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="stars">✨ ⭐ ✨ ⭐ ✨</div>

    <h1>Happy 7 Months Anniversary, Nasha 🥺❤️</h1>

    <p>
      Seven months already... and somehow you still manage
      to make every moment feel special.
    </p>

    <p>
      Here's to us, to the memories we've made,
      and to all the moments still waiting for us. ❤️
    </p>

    <div class="heart">❤️</div>

    <div class="stars">✨ ⭐ ✨ ⭐ ✨</div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
